{"3930550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Slime Changer", "steam_appid": 3930550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930550/extras/d98c3e9c240ce22fabdbc8fa33081141.poster.avif?t=1762448950\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930550/extras/d98c3e9c240ce22fabdbc8fa33081141.webm?t=1762448950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930550/extras/d98c3e9c240ce22fabdbc8fa33081141.mp4?t=1762448950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>A Slime that Evolves through Absorption and Transformation!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique action mechanic where you absorb enemies and freely use their forms and powers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just a typical monster.<br>You can transform into the humans and creatures you absorb—taking on not only their appearance but also their attack styles, skills, and even passive abilities.<br>Fight in their way, master their power, and forge your own path through a ruined world.<br>One character, countless ways to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930550/extras/467f5a2bc6c49c8e20d2092fe33af8d6.poster.avif?t=1762448950\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930550/extras/467f5a2bc6c49c8e20d2092fe33af8d6.webm?t=1762448950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930550/extras/467f5a2bc6c49c8e20d2092fe33af8d6.mp4?t=1762448950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>The Journey of a Slime Awakened in a World of Magic and Machinery</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dystopia where magic and technology, love and guilt, life and destruction intertwine.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world was once full of prosperity.<br>But human ambition to modify life itself through technology brought it to ruin.<br>Now, in a wasteland where machines and living beings are tangled together, a single slime awakens.<br>Each stage unveils a different aspect of this fallen world—one filled with sorrow, beauty, and terrifying truths.<br>Dive into a breathtakingly brutal dystopia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930550/extras/2fe0eaf6f99a42b5207a44daab1463e9.poster.avif?t=1762448950\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930550/extras/2fe0eaf6f99a42b5207a44daab1463e9.webm?t=1762448950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930550/extras/2fe0eaf6f99a42b5207a44daab1463e9.mp4?t=1762448950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Transform into Warriors, Elves, and Hunters—Each with Unique Styles and Skills!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every form you absorb demands a different strategy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each creature you absorb comes with a distinct combat style, unique skills, and specialized passives.<br>Charge forward as a close-range warrior, dominate from mid-range as a hunter, or control the battlefield from afar as a spell-casting elf.<br>Adapt to every situation by switching forms, crafting your own playstyle and tactical approach.<br>There’s no single way to play—only your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>A Story-Driven Stage-Clear System Beyond Ordinary Action Games</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The more you play, the deeper you fall into the world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage is crafted like a chapter—offering boss battles, challenge conditions, and shifting gameplay mechanics that keep things fresh.<br>But this isn't just about clearing stages.<br>You’ll constantly ask yourself: “Why am I fighting?” “What lies at the end of this path?”<br>Story and gameplay are seamlessly intertwined, ensuring every moment holds meaning.<br>Explore a world where beauty and brutality coexist—and feel something new in every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930550/extras/893c04e8fbbaa9e3afb6827b3da53671.poster.avif?t=1762448950\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930550/extras/893c04e8fbbaa9e3afb6827b3da53671.webm?t=1762448950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Who or What Is the Slime?</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The slime awakens with no memory of who or what it truly is. <br>A mysterious voice echoes from within, guiding it through a shattered world.<br>As the journey unfolds, puzzle pieces begin to align.<br>This isn’t the tale of a typical hero.<br>It’s a story that asks far deeper questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930550/extras/417bdba8012a3e8a5ad0aa06e28856e3.poster.avif?t=1762448950\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930550/extras/417bdba8012a3e8a5ad0aa06e28856e3.webm?t=1762448950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Core Features</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absorb and transform</strong> into a wide range of creatures, each with distinct combat styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic gameplay</strong> through unique skills, passives, and tactics for every transformation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dystopian world</strong> born of clashing magic and machinery, layered with narrative depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-rich stage-clear structure</strong>, where every level is a meaningful step in your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional pixel art visuals</strong>, blending dark fantasy with haunting beauty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully supports keyboard and gamepad</strong>, designed for immersive play across all setups</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930550/extras/d98c3e9c240ce22fabdbc8fa33081141.poster.avif?t=1762448950\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930550/extras/d98c3e9c240ce22fabdbc8fa33081141.webm?t=1762448950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930550/extras/d98c3e9c240ce22fabdbc8fa33081141.mp4?t=1762448950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>A Slime that Evolves through Absorption and Transformation!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique action mechanic where you absorb enemies and freely use their forms and powers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just a typical monster.<br>You can transform into the humans and creatures you absorb—taking on not only their appearance but also their attack styles, skills, and even passive abilities.<br>Fight in their way, master their power, and forge your own path through a ruined world.<br>One character, countless ways to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930550/extras/467f5a2bc6c49c8e20d2092fe33af8d6.poster.avif?t=1762448950\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930550/extras/467f5a2bc6c49c8e20d2092fe33af8d6.webm?t=1762448950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930550/extras/467f5a2bc6c49c8e20d2092fe33af8d6.mp4?t=1762448950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>The Journey of a Slime Awakened in a World of Magic and Machinery</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dystopia where magic and technology, love and guilt, life and destruction intertwine.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world was once full of prosperity.<br>But human ambition to modify life itself through technology brought it to ruin.<br>Now, in a wasteland where machines and living beings are tangled together, a single slime awakens.<br>Each stage unveils a different aspect of this fallen world—one filled with sorrow, beauty, and terrifying truths.<br>Dive into a breathtakingly brutal dystopia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930550/extras/2fe0eaf6f99a42b5207a44daab1463e9.poster.avif?t=1762448950\" width=1170 hei